          "type": "damage",
          "name": "Sear Undead",
          "cost": "free",
          "note": "On Turn Undead, roll (Wisdom modifier) d8s. Each undead failing the Turn Undead save takes that much Radiant damage. Track Wisdom modifier to determine the number of dice."
